SUMMARY:Information: BANK AND MONUMENT STATIONS: From Monday 20 October 
 2025 until November 2026. Replacement of escalators 4 and 5. These connect
  the Northern line platforms with the District and Circle line platforms. 
 While this work takes place\, the walking route between these platforms 
 will be closed. Please allow a little longer for your journey and follow 
 the signs\, which will direct you via an alternative walking route. 
 Depending on your journey\, this route may be via street level. To pay the
  correct fare\, just touch out as you exit and touch back in again\, as 
 you re-enter.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR